# ===================== KiCad =====================
# KiCad 10 的"本地历史"本身就是一个 git 仓库，必须忽略，否则会被当成嵌入仓库
Hardware/**/.history/
_restore_backup_*/

# 各种自动备份 / 临时文件
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*-backups/
~*.lck
*.kicad_prl
fp-info-cache

# ===================== Software =====================
# CubeMX / 编译中间产物
Software/**/build/
Software/**/Debug/
Software/**/Release/
Software/**/*.o
Software/**/*.d
Software/**/*.elf
Software/**/*.map
Software/**/*.lst

# ioc2kicad.py 生成的可再生成的图（需要留档就删掉这两行）
Software/kicad/*.svg
Software/kicad/*_preview.png

# ===================== 系统 =====================
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
